OL,3,GNEWSAMan who posed as medical student
OL,4,Aat hospital given community service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who posed as a medical student to
OL,7,Fgain access to hospital wards and
OL,8,Fpatient files has been ordered to carry
OL,9,Fout community service.
OL,11,FStephen Simpson previously admitted
OL,12,Fcarrying out the fraud at Aberdeen
OL,13,FRoyal Infirmary (ARI) between 9
OL,14,FDecember 2023 and 26 January 2024.
OL,16,FThe 22-year-old accessed the hospital
OL,17,Fwhile wearing medical scrubs, NHS
OL,18,Fbranded clothing, a stethoscope and a
OL,19,Fpager.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
