OL,3,GNEWSAMan who posed as medical student
OL,4,Aat hospital given community service
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Aberdeen Sheriff Court, Simpson was
OL,7,Ftold to carry out 300 hours of unpaid
OL,8,Fwork. He will also be supervised for
OL,9,Ftwo years. He did not comment as he
OL,10,Fleft court.
